OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as part of investigation
OL,4,Ainto 'smokies' selling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested as part of an
OL,7,Finvestigation into the online sale of
OL,8,Fillegal smokies meat.
OL,10,FThe Food Standards Agency's National
OL,11,FFood Crime Unit, alongside
OL,12,FLeicestershire Police and other
OL,13,Fagencies, were involved in enforcement
OL,14,Faction in the city on 24 September.
OL,16,FSmokies are skin-on sheep or goat meat,
OL,17,Fproduced by singeing the fleece off the
OL,18,Funskinned carcass, the FSA added, while
OL,19,Ftheir production is illegal in the UK
OL,20,Fas they do not comply with hygiene
OL,21,Fstandards and meat or food preparation
OL,22,Frequirements.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
