OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as part of investigation
OL,4,Ainto 'smokies' selling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency said on Monday the
OL,7,F38-year-old man had been arrested in
OL,8,FLeicester in connection with the sale
OL,9,Fof smokies via online platforms.
